Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.90,EN,,0,0,0,,OriEra World Engine -- AI-native, reality-blended, self-evolving
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:05.40,EN,,0,0,0,,(1) Word Spirit: speech becomes action -- words parsed into engine commands, physics rewritten live
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:09.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Type "spawn 600" -- L9 parses it into an engine command; the world answers next frame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:12.60,EN,,0,0,0,,"gravity 60" -- rewrite physics with one sentence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:14.80,EN,,0,0,0,,"how many" -- query world state in plain words
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:17.20,EN,,0,0,0,,zero gravity, slow time, teleport -- all spoken
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:22.50,EN,,0,0,0,,"dance" -- and the swarm dances
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:27.30,EN,,0,0,0,,(2) Corner Cafe -- cognition, long-term memory and an AI director, all engine systems
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:31.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Three NPCs live here: the owner, an illustrator, an engine hacker
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:36.50,EN,,0,0,0,,They talk on their own -- every line lands in long-term memory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:42.50,EN,,0,0,0,,They remember each other across turns; the AI director advances the story
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:47.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Join as a guest: any OpenAI-compatible key -- or just watch the offline rule engine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:51.20,EN,,0,0,0,,One engine loop the whole time: L9 cognition to L7 inference, budgeted per frame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:54.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Open source, Apache-2.0 -- github.com/OriEra-engine/engine
